    <briefdescription>
<para>Simple heads-up display overlay for rendering text on top of scenes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classHUD" kindref="compound">HUD</ref> renders a list of text lines at the top-right corner of the screen using screen-space pixel coordinates. Text textures are cached by content (text + color) to avoid re-rasterizing the same string every frame.</para>
<para>Rendered by <ref refid="classApplication" kindref="compound">Application</ref> after the scene, so it always appears on top.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classScene_1afb756dd8b7583f4b06a000d8157c7952" kindref="member">Scene::GetHUDLines</ref>, <ref refid="classApplication_1a6f40ffdb97f3a938ae19ea4eae4882ed" kindref="member">Application::Render</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
